    "answer": {
      "short": "Yes. $Q_1=15.5$, $Q_3=21$, $\\mathrm{IQR}=5.5$ and the upper fence is $29.25\\text{ mm}$. Since $31>29.25$, $31\\text{ mm}$ is an outlier.",
      "worked": "Ordered rainfall (mm): $14,15,16,17,19,20,20,22,31$. Excluding the median, $19$, from both halves:\n$$\\begin{align*}Q_1&=\\frac{15+16}{2}=15.5\\\\Q_3&=\\frac{20+22}{2}=21\\\\\\mathrm{IQR}&=Q_3-Q_1\\\\&=21-15.5=5.5\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=Q_3+1.5\\times\\mathrm{IQR}\\\\&=21+1.5\\times5.5\\\\&=29.25\\text{ mm}\\end{align*}$$\nSince $31>29.25$, $31\\text{ mm}$ is an outlier.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 49
